# Beacon security tools

When this project has the Beacon MCP server connected, call these tools instead of inventing security reviews:

- `check_security` — app code risks
- `scan_dependencies` — supply-chain / manifest risks
- `scan_infra` — infra and network posture
- `pre_deploy_check` — deploy gate (block on critical/high)

Call `pre_deploy_check` before production deploys or terraform apply. Fix critical/high findings before finishing.
